CHAPTER.VERS:
And when they 

          Lit. slew
         sacrificed their children to their idols, they also went into my sanctuary to profane it: and whereas they did thus in the midst of my house;

and they raised a sound of music, and that with men coming from the wilderness out of a multitude of men,
Alex. +’inflamed with wine.’ See A. V. margin and they put bracelets on their hands, and a crown of
Gr. boasting glory on their heads;
